### 경력 검색 디버깅

### 1. 동기화 먼저 실행
POST http://localhost:8082/api/search/sync

### 2. 전체 사용자 데이터 확인 (경력 범위 확인)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/test/all

### 3. 직접 LT_1 경력만 검색
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/test/experience/LT_1

### 4. 직접 Y1_3 경력만 검색  
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/test/experience/Y1_3

### 5. 직접 Y5_10 경력만 검색
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/test/experience/Y5_10

### 6. API로 LT_1만 검색
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/users?experienceRanges=LT_1

### 7. API로 Y1_3만 검색
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/users?experienceRanges=Y1_3

### 8. API로 LT_1과 Y1_3 다중 검색 (문제 상황)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/users?experienceRanges=LT_1&experienceRanges=Y1_3

### 9. 다른 조합으로 테스트
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/users?experienceRanges=FRESHER&experienceRanges=LT_1